# Line endings are pinned so that what a contributor checks out is byte-identical to
# what CI checks out. The repository blobs are LF already; without this rule a
# Windows contributor would get CRLF in the working tree while CI would get LF, and
# this plugin's tests assert on rendered page bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
